se,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-11T20:09:16Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T07:43:10Z","closed_at":"2026-09-11T22:25:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123431","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123431.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123431.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-11T22:25:27Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Should fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123427\r\n\r\n`String::uri_file_decode` does currently only accept upper case hex digits:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nprint(\"%5B\".uri_file_decode()) # prints [\r\nprint(\"%5b\".uri_file_decode()) # prints %5b\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever as per [RFC 3986](https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3986/#section-2.1) percent encoding is case insensitive:\r\n\r\n> The uppercase hexadecimal digits 'A' through 'F' are equivalent to the lowercase digits 'a' through 'f', respectively.\r\n\r\nIn the linked issue the external editor uses lowercase hex digits which currently breaks our decoding.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes our decoding to allow for lower case hex digits.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- `strtol` is case insensitive as per https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/string/byte/strtol\r\n\r\n> The case of the characters is ignored.\r\n\r\n- I adopted `is_hex_digit` which in theory does omit certain chars we previously considered valid since we used `is_ascii_upper_case`. Only allowing \"a\" through \"f\" seems more correct to me anyway, since percent encoding uses hex numbers.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123431/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123431/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}